{
  "name": "A growth factor is linked with improved survival in an important subtype of breast cancer",
  "parent_id": 203314441207318,
  "group_id": "a5eae955-339b-43db-b942-c1c3d9cab7d1",
  "alternates": [],
  "created_at": "2026-07-31T09:25:22.590Z",
  "deleted_at": null,
  "sort_by_date": null,
  "tag_list": [],
  "updated_at": "2026-08-12T15:16:04.410Z",
  "published_at": "2026-08-12T15:16:04.395Z",
  "id": 203982121354661,
  "uuid": "fc5433a8-fbf3-4eb3-bd50-c13e9b9c4317",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "d8afc280-cbf4-4956-f3a0-4a53d1648ee4",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "2843bb9a-b90e-1977-d5ca-d6dd01756dd2",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Contributors to this research include ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Dr Nazia Riaz",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.aku.edu/crm/people/Pages/nazia-riaz.aspx",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ", one of our faculty members, who is currently a post-doctoral fellow in ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Professor Torsten O Nielsen's lab",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "http://www.gpecdata.med.ubc.ca/torsten/index.html",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_self",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " at the University of British Columbia. This research was conducted in collaboration with Professor ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Shoukat Dedhar's ",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.bccrc.ca/dept/io/labs/dedhar-lab",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": "group and the ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "findings",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7957699/",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": " have been published in ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "Cancers",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "italic"
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "text": ".",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Preclinical studies suggest that interactions between G-CSF and CAIX regulate the trafficking and function of immune cells in the tumour microenvironment.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The research team investigated the clinical significance of this crosstalk by analysing the protein expression of G-CSF, macrophage marker CD163 and CAIX by immunohistochemistry on a well-characterised tissue microarray series of invasive breast cancers.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "The results of this study demonstrate the prognostic significance of G-CSF in invasive breast cancer, whereby high expression serves as an indicator of better survival in aggressive non-luminal subtype in the absence of CAIX expression.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Read the full article here: ",
                  "type": "text"
                },
                {
                  "text": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7957699/",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "link",
                      "attrs": {
                        "href": "https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC7957699/",
                        "uuid": null,
                        "anchor": null,
                        "custom": {},
                        "target": "_blank",
                        "linktype": "url"
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "hard_break"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
